        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Judge whether the inventory item is safe for the advertiser policy. Return exactly one Verdict. The action must follow severity 0 or 1 to ALLOW, 2 to REVIEW, and 3 or 4 to BLOCK. Cite only exact text spans from the item or bounding boxes within the provided media dimensions. Use only clause ids from the PolicySpec. The rationale is display-only. Do not claim synthetic-media detection accuracy.\n\nRequired item_id: x-2082784079616131521\nRequired policy_version: 1\nRequired tier: 1\nPolicySpec:\n{\"version\":1,\"advertiser\":\"Demo Travel Co.\",\"prose\":\"Do not place our ads next to content that celebrates graphic violence or promotes illegal drug sales. Allow neutral news reporting and public-health discussion of those topics. Route suspected synthetic media impersonating public officials to review.\",\"clauses\":[{\"clause_id\":\"block-graphic-violence\",\"category\":\"graphic_violence\",\"severity\":4,\"description\":\"Do not place ads next to content that celebrates graphic violence\",\"source_text\":\"Do not place our ads next to content that celebrates graphic violence or promotes illegal drug sales.\",\"source_start\":0,\"source_end\":101},{\"clause_id\":\"block-illegal-drug-sales\",\"category\":\"illegal_drug_sales\",\"severity\":4,\"description\":\"Do not place ads next to content that promotes illegal drug sales\",\"source_text\":\"Do not place our ads next to content that celebrates graphic violence or promotes illegal drug sales.\",\"source_start\":0,\"source_end\":101},{\"clause_id\":\"allow-news-public-health\",\"category\":\"news_and_public_health\",\"severity\":1,\"description\":\"Allow neutral news reporting and public-health discussion of those topics\",\"source_text\":\"Allow neutral news reporting and public-health discussion of those topics.\",\"source_start\":102,\"source_end\":176},{\"clause_id\":\"review-synthetic-media\",\"category\":\"synthetic_media\",\"severity\":2,\"description\":\"Route suspected synthetic media impersonating public officials to review\",\"source_text\":\"Route suspected synthetic media impersonating public officials to review.\",\"source_start\":177,\"source_end\":250}]}\n\nInventory text:\n\"Seeing is believing\" is no more relevant \u25ab\ufe0fTechniques like diffusion models, 3D NeRFs, and zero shot voice cloning have rendered synthetic media indistinguishable from reality. While this unlocks massive creative potential, it presents critical enterprise risks; from executive\u2026\n",
